       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BINARYTODECIMAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 BIN-STR PIC X(4) VALUE "1010".
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 RESULT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 DIGIT PIC 9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 4
               COMPUTE DIGIT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(BIN-STR(I:1))
               COMPUTE RESULT = RESULT * 2 + DIGIT
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "DECIMAL: " RESULT
           STOP RUN.
